  "body": "## Changelog\n* f523823219e260f757df100064d67ab767306389 Fix ssh console errors with redirected output on Windows (#5226)\n* e549fbfc7e5f1386a99fef086e21881d0ea5d531 Trace UIEX HTTP requests (#5219)\n* e1d1d46d1b8bc5a8bbd0ac232528462058fe1aa9 chore(deps): bump github.com/moby/moby/client from 0.5.1 to 0.6.0 (#5227)\n* 106fed1ba785489dcd33b704358df96b933f114c chore(deps): bump github.com/moby/buildkit from 0.32.2 to 0.33.0 (#5230)\n* 6d2f1818a9eee7af1a41e2f999e2cfc85e7d9d90 chore(deps): bump github.com/prometheus/client_model from 0.6.2 to 0.6.3 (#5231)\n* e29f675029dd29632028dc75c507f597759275e0 chore(deps): bump github.com/mark3labs/mcp-go from 1.0.0 to 1.1.0 (#5229)\n* 505cb87b14d3cd2ec96ed9c6e666929a0f553f75 chore(deps): bump github.com/olekukonko/tablewriter from 1.1.4 to 1.1.5 (#5228)\n* 620ac36c23516faa1d6847325e94113017f5aa1d Read the Machine version from version, not instance_id (#5218)\n* 22675ac9a7d742bd30db2b3b9dc56fb60d817e58 fix agent logs retention (#5198)\n* 7311eb6c4f7e9025d7232db473def824ba81613f Stop sending ssh exit errors to Sentry (#5225)\n* 0b7e9ee749286db2e60e081c71d66334acc4d6f6 chore(deps): bump github.com/vektah/gqlparser/v2 from 2.5.36 to 2.5.37 (#5215)\n* 21429173610f6307a42d1ae483d6664074ac5d96 chore(deps): bump github.com/mark3labs/mcp-go from 0.58.0 to 1.0.0 (#5214)\n* 97fe512dbcea6d71e9e46ab216b23d2f62296f6b chore(deps): bump github.com/google/go-containerregistry from 0.22.0 to 0.22.1 (#5213)\n* abc941b68fe6a711067fc9edae7b0cf15a217a6f chore(deps): bump the aws-sdk group with 2 updates (#5212)\n* a61138fe9983e1b0b385b39bab7e75b30437834d chore(deps): bump the golangx group with 2 updates (#5211)\n* 8d676800b9b5201dda85f350a140ac637b4fb676 Pause the docs sync until the generator emits MDX (#5223)\n\n"
}
